---
import MainLayout from '../../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
const pageTitle = 'nanobot：超轻量级 OpenClaw 替代品';
const pageDescription = '介绍 nanobot，一个超轻量级的个人 AI 助手，灵感来源于 OpenClaw';
---
<MainLayout
  title={pageTitle}
  description={pageDescription}
>
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 py-8">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6">nanobot：超轻量级 OpenClaw 替代品</h1>
    <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-lg p-6 shadow-md">
      <div class="mb-6">
        <p class="mb-4">nanobot 是一个超轻量级的个人 AI 助手，灵感来源于 OpenClaw，以其极简设计和高效性能而闻名。它提供了核心代理功能，代码行数比 OpenClaw 少 99%，同时保持了强大的功能。</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">主要特点</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mb-4">
          <li><strong>超轻量级</strong>：OpenClaw 的超轻量实现，体积小 99%，速度显著更快</li>
          <li><strong>研究就绪</strong>：代码干净易读，易于理解、修改和扩展用于研究</li>
          <li><strong>闪电般快速</strong>：最小占用意味着启动更快、资源使用更低、迭代更快</li>
          <li><strong>易于使用</strong>：一键部署，即可使用</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      <div class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">核心功能</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-4">
          <div class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 rounded-lg p-4">
            <h3 class="font-medium mb-2">📈 24/7 实时市场分析</h3>
            <p class="text-sm">持续监控市场动态，提供实时分析和洞察</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 rounded-lg p-4">
            <h3 class="font-medium mb-2">🚀 全栈软件工程师</h3>
            <p class="text-sm">协助开发工作，提供代码建议和解决方案</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 rounded-lg p-4">
            <h3 class="font-medium mb-2">📅 智能日常行程管理器</h3>
            <p class="text-sm">帮助规划和管理日常任务和行程</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 rounded-lg p-4">
            <h3 class="font-medium mb-2">📚 个人知识助手</h3>
            <p class="text-sm">管理和检索个人知识，提供智能问答</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">最新更新</h2>
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <div class="flex items-start">
            <span class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mr-3">2026-03-08</span>
            <p><strong>v0.1.4.post4</strong> — 可靠性版本，包含更安全的默认设置、更好的多实例支持、更强大的 MCP 以及主要的渠道和提供商改进</p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start">
            <span class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mr-3">2026-03-07</span>
            <p>Azure OpenAI 提供商、WhatsApp 媒体、QQ 群聊以及更多 Telegram/Feishu 改进</p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start">
            <span class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mr-3">2026-03-06</span>
            <p>更轻量级的提供商、更智能的媒体处理以及更强大的内存和 CLI 兼容性</p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start">
            <span class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mr-3">2026-03-05</span>
            <p>Telegram 草稿流、MCP SSE 支持以及更广泛的渠道可靠性修复</p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start">
            <span class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mr-3">2026-03-04</span>
            <p>依赖清理、更安全的文件读取以及另一轮测试和 Cron 修复</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">支持的平台和集成</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mb-4">
          <div class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 rounded-lg p-3 text-center">
            <p class="font-medium">Telegram</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 rounded-lg p-3 text-center">
            <p class="font-medium">Feishu</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 rounded-lg p-3 text-center">
            <p class="font-medium">Discord</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 rounded-lg p-3 text-center">
            <p class="font-medium">Slack</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 rounded-lg p-3 text-center">
            <p class="font-medium">WhatsApp</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 rounded-lg p-3 text-center">
            <p class="font-medium">QQ</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 rounded-lg p-3 text-center">
            <p class="font-medium">Email</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 rounded-lg p-3 text-center">
            <p class="font-medium">Matrix</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">支持的 AI 模型提供商</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mb-4">
          <div class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 rounded-lg p-3 text-center">
            <p class="font-medium">OpenAI</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 rounded-lg p-3 text-center">
            <p class="font-medium">Anthropic</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 rounded-lg p-3 text-center">
            <p class="font-medium">Moonshot/Kimi</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 rounded-lg p-3 text-center">
            <p class="font-medium">DeepSeek</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 rounded-lg p-3 text-center">
            <p class="font-medium">MiniMax</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 rounded-lg p-3 text-center">
            <p class="font-medium">Qwen</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 rounded-lg p-3 text-center">
            <p class="font-medium">Azure OpenAI</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700 rounded-lg p-3 text-center">
            <p class="font-medium">VolcEngine</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">技术特性</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mb-4">
          <li>MCP 支持（模型上下文协议）</li>
          <li>进度流式传输</li>
          <li>多渠道媒体支持</li>
          <li>实时市场分析</li>
          <li>智能日常行程管理</li>
          <li>个人知识助手</li>
          <li>全栈软件开发支持</li>
          <li>Docker 支持</li>
          <li>Linux 服务支持</li>
          <li>多实例支持</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      <div class="mb-6">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">项目链接</h2>
        <p class="mb-4">GitHub 仓库：<a href="https://github.com/HKUDS/nanobot" class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:underline">https://github.com/HKUDS/nanobot</a></p>
        <p>nanobot 是一个开源项目，欢迎贡献和反馈！</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</MainLayout>